type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"Every attempt resolves to a difficulty tier (`easy` / `medium` / `hard` / `expert`) from\n`ModelDifficulty`, then `VehicleClassDifficulty`, then `DefaultDifficulty`."},"580":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-8","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"**Lockpick:** use `lockpick` or `advanced_lockpick` near a locked vehicle. Pass the minigame, then the server rolls the tier's chance. Tools lose durability and may trigger the alarm."},"581":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-9","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"**Hotwire:** press `H` in a vehicle you have no key for, with `Config.Hotwire.HotwireItem`. A progress bar runs for the tier's time, then the minigame at the tier's level, then the server rolls the chance."},"582":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-10","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"**Search:** press `Y` in a parked vehicle to search for its key (`Config.KeySearching`)."},"583":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-11","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"Models in `Config.Blacklist.Models` can't be lockpicked, hotwired or carjacked (per action)."},"584":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-12","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#lockpicking--hotwiring","content":"With `Config.Minigames = 'tr_minigames'`, tr\\_minigames handles these flows. See\nCompatibility."},"585":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-13","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"Aim a gun at an NPC driver within `Distance` of a car slower than `MaxSpeed`. The driver brakes and\na progress bar starts; it cancels if you stop aiming or move away."},"586":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-14","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"**Success:** the driver gets out and runs, the car unlocks, you get its key and police are alerted."},"587":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-15","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"**Failure:** the driver drives off or fights back (`FailBehavior`)."},"588":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-16","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#carjacking","content":"The aim check only runs while a weapon is drawn. Each player has a `Cooldown` between attempts."},"589":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-17","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#police","content":"Jobs in `Config.PoliceBypass.Jobs` (at the minimum grade, on duty, and carrying `police_bypass` if\nset) can lock, unlock, insert the ignition and start the engine on any vehicle. With\n`UseItemToUnlock`, using the item unlocks the closest vehicle. Carjacking a blacklisted vehicle\nwith the bypass is allowed and sends no dispatch."},"590":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-18","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#police","content":"Successful lockpicks, hotwires and carjacks send a dispatch alert based on `Config.Dispatch.Chance`."},"591":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-19","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**Key cutting:** at a key cutting station or with the `key_cutting_tool`. Copies a key from the locksmith's inventory or a nearby vehicle. Uses a `blank_key`."},"592":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-20","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**OBD programming:** for keyless vehicles. The locksmith sits in the driver's seat and uses the `locksmith_tablet`."},"593":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-21","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**Invalidate old keys:** optional when making a key. Generates a new key ID so every old copy stops working."},"594":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-22","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**NPC store:** when `OfflineStore.MininumDuty` or fewer locksmiths are on duty, players can buy spare keys for vehicles they own. Prices are enforced on the server."},"595":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-23","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#locksmith","content":"**Ignition repair:** use `electrical_tools` in a hotwired vehicle to clear the hotwire. Only needed when `Config.Hotwire.SaveHotwireState` is on."},"596":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-24","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"`/keyadmin` lists stored and spawned vehicles (spawned ones have a green dot). For each vehicle you can:"},"597":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-25","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"toggle keyless, keys-in-ignition, engine-on and hotwired"},"598":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-26","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"add or remove jobs with access"},"599":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-27","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"regenerate the key ID, making every existing key useless"},"600":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-28","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"give a key to an online player"},"601":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-29","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"delete the stored record"},"602":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-30","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#admin-panel","content":"Every action is checked on the server against the `command.keyadmin` permission."},"603":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-31","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#key-validation","content":"A key item is valid when its plate and key ID match the vehicle's current key ID. The server keeps\nthat ID on the spawned vehicle, or in the `filo_vehiclekeys` table for owned vehicles that aren't\nspawned. Checks never trust client data."},"604":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows-32","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys/flows#key-validation","content":"Keys for unowned vehicles (NPC, stolen or job cars) are removed when the vehicle is deleted and\nafter a server restart (`Config.KeyCleanup`). Player-owned vehicles always keep their keys."},"605":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","type":"page","content":"🔑 filo_vehiclekeys","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Paid Resources","🔑 filo_vehiclekeys"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys"},"606":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-0","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","content":"Item-based vehicle keys, theft, police and locksmith system for FiveM."},"607":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-1","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Features"},"608":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-2","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#pages","content":"Pages"},"609":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-3","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","content":"Item-based vehicle keys for FiveM: physical keys and key fobs, ignition handling, lockpicking,\nhotwiring, NPC carjacking, a locksmith job, police dispatch and an admin panel. All outcomes are\ndecided on the server and everything is tuned from `shared/sh-config.lua`."},"610":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-4","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","content":"Current version: **2.0.0**. Framework, inventory, minigame, dispatch and target code lives in the\nopen `bridge/` folder, so you can adapt it to your server."},"611":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-5","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"**Keys**"},"612":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-6","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Keys are `vehiclekey` items tied to a plate and a key ID; a new key ID instantly invalidates every old copy"},"613":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-7","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Mechanical keys and keyless fobs (auto-detected for electric models, or per model)"},"614":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-8","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Key fob UI: lock, unlock, trunk, panic, remote engine, convertible roof, summon, auto-lock and auto-start"},"615":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-9","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Insert/remove keys from the ignition, hold to start the engine"},"616":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-10","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Job keys: give a whole job access to a vehicle without an item"},"617":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-11","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Keys for unowned vehicles are removed on despawn and after a restart"},"618":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-12","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"**Theft**"},"619":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-13","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Lockpick and advanced lockpick with per-tier success chances, durability and alarm chance"},"620":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-14","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Hotwiring with per-tier times and minigame difficulty"},"621":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-15","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Difficulty tiers mapped by GTA vehicle class, with per-model overrides"},"622":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-16","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"Searching parked vehicles for keys"},"623":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-17","page_id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys#features","content":"NPC carjacking: aim at a driver, hold them up, take the car and its key"},"624":{"id":"/docs/paid_resources/filo_vehiclekeys-18","page_id":"/docs/paid_r